@startuml
actor Alice
actor Bob
participant Notary as "Non-Validating Notary"
actor Charlie

== Initial State Submission ==
Bob -> Alice : Provides input state (owned by Bob’s conf. identity)
note over Alice
Receives state but not cert path
Cannot validate identity ownership yet
end note

== Alice Builds Transaction ==
Alice -> Notary : Submits input state hashes (incl. Bob's state)
Notary --> Alice : OK
note right of Notary
Non-validating: No identity visibility
end note

== IdentitySyncFlow Threat ==
Alice -> Bob : Runs IdentitySyncFlow
note right of Bob
Expects cert path for Bob's conf. identity
end note

alt Malicious or Faulty Behavior
note over Alice
Alice omits Bob's cert
(Bob's conf. key is in tx but unverifiable)
end note
Alice --> Bob : Sends incomplete certs

Bob -> Alice : Rejects transaction (cannot validate inputs)

else Normal Behavior
Alice --> Bob : Sends cert for Bob's conf. identity
Bob -> Alice : Accepts transaction
end alt

== Transaction to Charlie ==
Bob -> Charlie : Includes Alice’s conf. key in a state
note over Charlie
Sees Alice’s conf. key
But needs cert path to validate ownership
Alice must cooperate again
end note

@enduml
